Modified for Sklubot (2026-11-18): both systems were condensed; the commercial typefaces of Warm Editorial were replaced by free ones (Source Serif 4, Inter) and its reference to a named magazine removed; dark-mode values were added; the muted grey, the terracotta and the cobalt were darkened slightly to reach 4.5:1 text contrast; the DESIGN.md structure became a "design system card" written for Sklubot (memory_save, files on the bot's computer); a French translation (SKILL.fr.md) was added.
Not included, on purpose: the 140-odd OpenDesign packages that imitate a real company's brand (for example the apple, stripe, linear-app, notion, airbnb, spotify, tesla packages), and the generated "Design System Inspired by …" style packages, whose provenance is not documented. No tokens.css, component, font, image or preview file is bundled: only text.
